{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:13:08Z","created_by_operation":"op_c1ecb2a6ab9c409f8b0bea70cdd5cc55","id":"pg_4f98c6631346528a838f879bd92693e3","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/oinone-oinone-pamirs-readme-zh-cn-md-32d4a041f66d-879bd92693e3.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_3d2abfb7e4615f2cad7fe9a1bc09c68f"],"title":"oinone/oinone-pamirs/README_zh-CN.md @ 32d4a041f66d","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:13:08Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c1ecb2a6ab9c409f8b0bea70cdd5cc55"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0fe80199ecc82e817b6745980cd12ec8c5e10168f401ebe3922fa18b1b7996e2"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The documented quickstart deploys via a downloaded docker-compose.yml started with 'docker compose -p oinone up -d'."},{"claim_ids":["clm_169d9d57db34845ea0198ad3eff5f70928204c9491f8013e7802dccd8d4b0a96"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Documentation is hosted externally at guide.oinone.ai, covering installation/upgrade, user manual, dev manual, tutorials, and common solutions."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1fa17c74f8b8cc5e7953898d9a164d582deff1fe5c8a9e151ff41c42426dd5f9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"First boot of the Docker deployment is documented to take a few minutes and can be monitored with 'docker logs -f oinone-backend'."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5e3a3ae0210e6c8eb2a50351ec5f34f3556557f348782890cdb11b6b8cce3666"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The framework targets developers, enterprise R&D teams, and software companies, with claimed served customers across domains such as MES, APS, ERP, HIS, and OMS."},{"claim_ids":["clm_85ac778e5c51ec8768337477310bfe7998e726e66e993ab4d6ca4d879745a6fc"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Applications built on the framework are said to inherently include a Data-Feedback Loop (DFL) mechanism supporting a lifecycle of training, modeling, execution, evaluation, and autonomous execution."},{"claim_ids":["clm_865090c0d7c896009f31634128591485f3f7f7b20ebc0b261f9ce0d98b92d39d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The framework self-describes as 100% metadata-driven, combining metadata-driven design with visual no-code design as a standardized development discipline rather than a free-form scaffold."},{"claim_ids":["clm_981dbb516cb48105003197b2e306c6f0838fe043cac0e8316d61ad36276b973e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Aino is described as an ontology-based enterprise AI agent full-lifecycle platform integrating model access, fine-tuning, tool/skill libraries, knowledge bases, and agent orchestration."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b7b632df1af6c2821b2b1665757e99eaea8b8503ee4f396f65466047d1f49f49"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Contribution guidance is provided via an external 'How to contribute' page linked from the README's community participation section."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d82ec72eed11c3d4d617615aac4ee4b17f64b8b4ea9914a6c60afc338c93cfc0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The repository is licensed under AGPL-3.0, with a separate third-party open-source license notice published externally."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e7da2486a7220e1f0c8bc352ee194a4867b318afe96444ed55d279f6e38dc274"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Oinone Pamirs is described as the back-end repository of an AI-powered low-code framework positioned as infrastructure for AI-native enterprise applications."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f14cf6e28480ca87b12d23670f7eb333d1ff3c73c6fd472993bf34e49c1248de"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project is organized into packages including pamirs-k2 (metadata core), pamirs-framework (framework core), pamirs-framework-commons, and pamirs-framework-adaptor (framework extension)."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0fe80199ecc82e817b6745980cd12ec8c5e10168f401ebe3922fa18b1b7996e2","clm_169d9d57db34845ea0198ad3eff5f70928204c9491f8013e7802dccd8d4b0a96","clm_1fa17c74f8b8cc5e7953898d9a164d582deff1fe5c8a9e151ff41c42426dd5f9","clm_5e3a3ae0210e6c8eb2a50351ec5f34f3556557f348782890cdb11b6b8cce3666","clm_85ac778e5c51ec8768337477310bfe7998e726e66e993ab4d6ca4d879745a6fc","clm_865090c0d7c896009f31634128591485f3f7f7b20ebc0b261f9ce0d98b92d39d","clm_981dbb516cb48105003197b2e306c6f0838fe043cac0e8316d61ad36276b973e","clm_b7b632df1af6c2821b2b1665757e99eaea8b8503ee4f396f65466047d1f49f49","clm_d82ec72eed11c3d4d617615aac4ee4b17f64b8b4ea9914a6c60afc338c93cfc0","clm_e7da2486a7220e1f0c8bc352ee194a4867b318afe96444ed55d279f6e38dc274","clm_f14cf6e28480ca87b12d23670f7eb333d1ff3c73c6fd472993bf34e49c1248de"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:13:07Z","created_by_operation":"op_c1ecb2a6ab9c409f8b0bea70cdd5cc55","id":"pg_b2d9